1
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Once a year she rises. For one season she reigns.

2
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Snow Queen is a adventure, family, fantasy film directed by David Wu.

3
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Since a bitter winter storm stole the life of Gerda's mother, she and her
father have sadly continued to run the remote hotel they call home.

4
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Lonely and isolated, Gerda's only joy is Kai, the handsome bellboy.

5
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
A mysterious guest with an icy stare arrives at the hotel
one night, wrapped in fur and diamonds.

6
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
By daybreak, the "Snow Queen" has vanished with Kai!

7
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Gerda embarks on a journey of morphing seasons, fantastical creatures, and
long-frozen mysteries in a desperate quest to find her stolen love.

8
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Snow Queen, played by Bridget Fonda.

9
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
Kai, played by Jeremy Guilbaut.

10
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
Gerda, played by Chelsea Hobbs.

11
01:39:00,000 --> 01:39:06,000
Wolfgang, played by Robert Wisden.

12
01:48:00,000 --> 01:48:06,000
Minna, played by Wanda Cannon.

13
01:57:00,000 --> 01:57:06,000
Robber Girl, played by Meghan Black.

14
02:06:00,000 --> 02:06:06,000
Snow Queen is a 2002 made-for-television film produced by Hallmark Entertainment and directed
by David Wu based on the 1844 story The Snow Queen by Hans Christian Andersen.

15
02:15:00,000 --> 02:15:06,000
Also known as The Winter Witch, the film stars Bridget Fonda as the title
character and Chelsea Hobbs as her rival and the story's heroine, Gerda.

16
02:24:00,000 --> 02:24:06,000
The film originally aired on Hallmark Channel as a two-part miniseries, but has
since been released as a full-length film on DVD in the United States.

17
02:33:00,000 --> 02:33:06,000
The DVD was released in the United Kingdom on November 9,
2009 and in Australia on September 2, 2011.

18
02:42:00,000 --> 02:42:06,000
This was Bridget Fonda's last acting role before her retirement.

19
02:51:00,000 --> 02:51:06,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
